You just said that on live TV.

1080
01:04:27,671 --> 01:04:29,501
- Ugh. Fine.
- Fine.

1081
01:04:29,639 --> 01:04:30,847
- Fine.
- Fine!

1082
01:04:30,985 --> 01:04:32,642
Fine!

1083
01:04:35,541 --> 01:04:39,027
And now, my beautiful army,
destroy them.

1084
01:04:39,165 --> 01:04:40,236
Gooba gabba.

1085
01:04:40,374 --> 01:04:42,824
Gooba gabba. Gooba gabba.

1086
01:04:49,003 --> 01:04:50,349
Whoa!

1087
01:05:03,949 --> 01:05:06,607
Gooba gabba.

1088
01:05:13,510 --> 01:05:14,891
