Yeah! Oh!

1096
01:05:52,584 --> 01:05:53,930
Looks bad, Dog Man.

1097
01:05:54,068 --> 01:05:56,104
We've only been partners
for like six minutes,

1098
01:05:56,242 --> 01:05:57,796
but it's been real.

1099
01:05:57,934 --> 01:05:59,694
I've matured and I respect you,

1100
01:05:59,832 --> 01:06:02,076
even if I'm only saying that
for dramatic impact

1101
01:06:02,214 --> 01:06:05,182
and I'm actually still evil
and rotten inside.

1102
01:06:06,632 --> 01:06:07,840
Dog Man?

1103
01:06:07,978 --> 01:06:09,980
Dog Man.

1104
01:06:13,190 --> 01:06:14,744
Wha...

1105
01:06:14,882 --> 01:06:16,711
Not in the mouth.

1106
01:06:16,849 --> 01:06:18,437
- Petey, look.
- Hold on, hold on.

1107
01:06:18,575 --> 01:06:20,439
I know you need to arrest me
for escaping from Cat Jail...

1108
01:06:22,130 --> 01:06:23,822
