causing mayhem out there.

1109
01:06:23,960 --> 01:06:25,444
They're destroying the city.

1110
01:06:25,582 --> 01:06:27,377
Things can't possibly
get any worse.

1111
01:06:27,515 --> 01:06:29,379
Chief, turns out we actually

1112
