Whoa!
We got a cave-in back here.

1120
01:07:17,393 --> 01:07:19,084
Aah! Run!

1121
01:07:24,054 --> 01:07:25,711
Climb up. Come on.

1122
01:07:30,302 --> 01:07:32,615
Gooba gabba.

1123
01:07:34,444 --> 01:07:36,170
