What the... Who's that?

1128
01:07:44,074 --> 01:07:46,076
Robo-Cat?

1129
01:07:46,939 --> 01:07:49,079
Flippy-ki-yay, Flippy flipper.

1130
01:07:49,217 --> 01:07:50,426
