- Huh?

1131
01:07:50,564 --> 01:07:52,324
Yeah!

1132
01:07:57,260 --> 01:08:00,159
Gooba gabba!

1133
01:08:04,957 --> 01:08:06,234
Whoa.

1134
01:08:14,346 --> 01:08:16,659
-Gooba gabba.
- Go, go, go, go, go!

1135
01:08:18,695 --> 01:08:22,285
No! You can't escape me,
you sniveling little...

1136
01:08:22,423 --> 01:08:23,528
Come here!

1137
01:08:23,666 --> 01:08:26,289
Oh, do-gooders.

1138
01:08:26,427 --> 01:08:27,739
Li'l Petey!

1139
01:08:30,535 --> 01:08:33,192
Dog Man?

1140
01:08:34,159 --> 01:08:35,678
Papa.

1141
01:08:35,816 --> 01:08:37,127
Flippy is coming this way!

1142
01:08:37,265 --> 01:08:38,750
Oh, Robo-Cat.

1143
01:08:38,888 --> 01:08:41,269
Come out and play.

1144
01:08:41,407 --> 01:08:42,478
Everybody, clear out.

1145
01:08:42,616 --> 01:08:44,756
You'll never get away,
Robo-Cat.

1146
01:08:44,894 --> 01:08:46,171
Come on. Let's go.

1147
01:08:46,309 --> 01:08:48,380
I'll hunt you down
to my last breath.

1148
01:08:48,518 --> 01:08:49,864
What are you waiting for?

1149
01:08:50,002 --> 01:08:53,212
I'll never stop
till you're dead, Robo-Cat!

1150
01:08:53,350 --> 01:08:55,318
