1151
01:08:55,456 --> 01:08:57,009
It's me he wants.

1152
01:08:57,147 --> 01:08:59,943
Robo-Cat.

1153
01:09:00,081 --> 01:09:01,911
Oh, Robo-Cat.

1154
01:09:02,601 --> 01:09:04,085
Take him, Dog Man.

1155
01:09:04,223 --> 01:09:07,157
