and do the wrong thing.

1159
01:09:17,098 --> 01:09:18,928
- For me.
-Robo-Cat.

1160
01:09:19,066 --> 01:09:22,103
But, Papa,
Flippy's gonna destroy you.

1161
01:09:22,241 --> 01:09:23,311
I'll be okay, kid.

